{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15485","headline":"游终南山因寄苏奉礼士尊师苗员外 · 李端","name":"游终南山因寄苏奉礼士尊师苗员外","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"半岭逢仙驾，清晨独采芝。\n壶中开白日，雾里卷朱旗。\n猨鸟知归路，松萝见会时。\n鸡声传洞远，鹤语报家迟。\n童子闲驱石，樵夫乐看棊。\n依稀醉後拜，恍惚梦中辞。\n海上终难接，人间益自疑。\n风尘甘独老，山水但相思。\n愿得烧丹诀，流沙永待师。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李端","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_15485.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15485","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}